,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462693885,"data":"    86           8          8       0        0            0            0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462696192,"data":"    89           8          8       0        0            0            0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462698415,"data":"    90           8          8       0        0            0            0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.46270065,"data":"    100          8          8       0        0            0            0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462702964,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462705074,"data":"    sm_75 + ieee : 0 mma.sync, 256 fma.rn.f32\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462707308,"data":"    sm_80 + ieee : 0 mma.sync, 256 fma.rn.f32\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462709522,"data":"    sm_80 + tf32 : 8 mma.sync, 0 fma.rn.f32\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462711787,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462713888,"data":"    Reading.  The silicon at sm_80 can take a tf32 MMA path; the\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462716131,"data":"    silicon at sm_75 cannot, and fla additionally switches the\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462718375,"data":"    whole PROCESS off it by writing TRITON_F32_DEFAULT='ieee' at\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462720597,"data":"    import.  On this card the two gates fail independently and in\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.46272283,"data":"    the same direction, which is why every dot becomes fma.rn.f32\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462726876,"data":"    and no MMA instruction is emitted anywhere -- section 6 shows\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462729752,"data":"    that in the artifact of a real launch, and section A of\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.46273204,"data":"    sass_t4 shows it in 46 real cubins.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462734315,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462736416,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462738665,"data":"4. the kernel that actually runs, and the config list it was given\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462740908,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462743245,"data":"  decorator chain, outermost first: Heuristics -\u003e CachedAutotuner\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462745553,"data":"  autotuner found: True\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462747715,"data":"  module-level: NUM_WARPS = [2, 4, 8, 16]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462749943,"data":"  module-level: GATED_DELTA_RULE_FWD_H_NUM_WARPS = [2, 4]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462752245,"data":"  THE CONFIG SPACE, live: 4 configs\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462754419,"data":"    BV=32   num_warps=2   num_stages=2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462756598,"data":"    BV=32   num_warps=2   num_stages=1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462758846,"data":"    BV=32   num_warps=4   num_stages=2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462761044,"data":"    BV=32   num_warps=4   num_stages=1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462763246,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462765342,"data":"  distinct BV        [32]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462767622,"data":"  distinct num_stages[1, 2]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462769803,"data":"  distinct num_warps [2, 4]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462771977,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462774081,"data":"  the model says, from the gate return values:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462776262,"data":"    num_stages [2, 1]      (check_shared_mem('ampere') = False)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462778503,"data":"    BV         [32]         (check_shared_mem('ada')    = False)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462780732,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462782836,"data":"  MODEL vs OBSERVED: AGREE\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462785021,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462787135,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462789362,"data":"5. one real forward, then the config autotune actually picked\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462791605,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462793893,"data":"  calling fla.ops.kda.chunk_kda  B=1 T=128 H=2 HV=2 K=128 V=128 dtype=torch.bfloat16  grad off\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462796185,"data":"  inputs: the STUDY's own generator (kda/kda_vs_fla.py:296 `rnd`), with\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462798449,"data":"  q,k L2-normalised. Raw Gaussians make the delta-rule matrix\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462800695,"data":"  (I - beta k k^T) have eigenvalues near 1 - K*beta and the state\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462802988,"data":"  diverges; that is a property of the generator, not of fla.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462806958,"data":"  dtype: torch.bfloat16 is the only option. The FlashKDA verifier requires bf16\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462809307,"data":"  (flash_kda.py:64-88) and the study's call shape is bf16\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462811535,"data":"  (kda/baseline_pin.py:392). fp16 would be a different payload type\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462813768,"data":"  with a different numerics story, not a free substitute.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462816014,"data":"  returned o: shape=(1, 128, 2, 128) dtype=torch.bfloat16 finite=True  absmax=6.1523e-02\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462818317,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462820401,"data":"  Autotuner.cache has 1 entries after ONE call:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462822908,"data":"    key=(2, 2, 128, 128, 64, False, 'torch.bfloat16', 'torch.bfloat16', 'torch.bfloat16', 'torch.bfloat16', 'torch.float32', 'torch.bfloat16')\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462825288,"data":"      -\u003e BV=32 num_warps=4 num_stages=1  (from a space of 4)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462827559,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462829837,"data":"  the config space was the SHORTENED one, and autotune picked out of\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462832164,"data":"  exactly that short list. There was no refusal anywhere in this run.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462834502,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462836683,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462838938,"data":"6. dot precision, read out of a compiled artifact\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462841275,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462843518,"data":"  A 32x32x32 tl.dot with no explicit input_precision, compiled here on\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462845773,"data":"  this card, and the PTX searched for mma.sync vs fma.rn.f32.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462848006,"data":"  This is not a read of a variable; it is a read of the code ptxas was\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.46285026,"data":"  handed.  If fla had left TRITON_F32_DEFAULT alone, this would emit\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462852494,"data":"  mma.sync with tf32 operands.  If it wrote 'ieee', it emits fma.rn.f32.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462854757,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.46285758,"data":"  DOT_PROBE {\"ptx_mma_sync\": 0, \"ptx_mma\": 0, \"ptx_fma_rn_f32\": 256, \"ptx_cvt_tf32\": 0, \"ptx_target\": [\".version 8.7\", \".target sm_75\"], \"ptx_sha256\": \"76b505b47e2532d358fbd807b49f8e903006ae949cc743fe0339e9f6869015eb\", \"cubin_sha256\": \"f817d5d5d910e870ef3802cc1daa774d8ffd9c9157fd6af63455e9dace2bafbc\", \"n_regs\": 59, \"n_spills\": 0, \"env_TRITON_F32_DEFAULT\": \"ieee\", \"triton_knob_fp32_default\": \"'ieee'\"}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462862259,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.46286435,"data":"  and the knob itself, after fla was imported by that subprocess:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462866583,"data":"    os.environ['TRITON_F32_DEFAULT']          ieee\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462868789,"data":"    triton.knobs.language.fp32_default         'ieee'\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462871006,"data":"    fla IS_TF32_SUPPORTED                     False\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462873202,"data":"    is 'ieee' set by fla, or was it already there when fla loaded?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462875445,"data":"    BEFORE fla import: None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.46287934,"data":"    AFTER  fla import: 'ieee'\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462881625,"data":"    triton knob        : 'ieee'\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462883827,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462885928,"data":"  SOLVE_TRIL_DOT_PRECISION, the one dot fla pins explicitly:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462888232,"data":"    constexpr[ieee]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462890409,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462892515,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462894784,"data":"7. THE SCOPE LABEL, assembled from what was observed above\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462897028,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462899338,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462901711,"data":"  fla on T4, degraded configuration - num_stages=[1, 2], BV=[32], num_warps=[2, 4], process-global IEEE fp32 (TRITON_F32_DEFAULT='ieee', written by fla at import) - this is what the reference does in its worst configuration, not what it does at its best\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462904292,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462906405,"data":"  short form, for a table cell:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462908563,"data":"  fla/T4 degraded [stages=1/2, BV=32, warps=2/4, ieee-fp32 dots]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.46291079,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.46291288,"data":"  NOT a claim about fla.  The same code on a card with \u003e= 166,912 B\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462915192,"data":"  optin shared memory and cc major \u003e= 8 gets num_stages=[2,3,4],\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462917513,"data":"  BV=[32,64] and tf32 dots.  Nothing here measures that.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462919722,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462921823,"data":"wrote kda_t4/out/gate_observed.{txt,json} and dot_probe.json\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462924052,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.462926218,"data":"\u003e\u003e\u003e stage gate exit=0  (289 s)\n"}
