,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463119508,"data":"B. THE AOT SWEEP -- same source, same triton, five architectures\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463121763,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463129857,"data":"  A Triton compiler does not need the hardware it targets, so the\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463132736,"data":"  other cards in this study's card table can be COMPILED here, on a T4,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463135004,"data":"  by passing an explicit GPUTarget.  What comes out is a statement about\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463137278,"data":"  a compilation at that arch.  It is not a timing, and nothing in this\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463139574,"data":"  section may be read as one.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463141799,"data":"  triton 3.6.0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463143976,"data":"  source: /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/fla/ops/common/chunk_delta_h.py\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463146248,"data":"  sha256 ff461bcc40e9cd0b...  794 lines\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463148459,"data":"  stripped copy written to out/sass/aot_kernel.py\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463150685,"data":"  extracted by ast.get_source_segment, 289 lines, sha256 132afbfb07b58ffd...\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.46315296,"data":"  the segment is byte-identical to the file's own text: True\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463155268,"data":"  removed: @triton.heuristics({USE_G: ..., USE_GK: ..., ...}) and\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463157553,"data":"           @fla_cache_autotune(configs=[...], key=[...])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463159844,"data":"  the second is why the config list is passed as explicit constexprs\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.46316211,"data":"  below: an autotuner benchmarks its candidates, which needs a device,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463164454,"data":"  and it would benchmark them against THIS card's gate anyway.\n"}
