,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463882297,"data":"  'x fla' is side/fla: 1.00 means the side matched the reference on this\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463884561,"data":"  card, \u003e1 means the side was slower.  It is a ratio of two whole\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.46388686,"data":"  operators, same inputs, same shape, same dtype, same card, same\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463889113,"data":"  process.  LEGALITY, answered before the number is read (notes/19 5.1):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463891385,"data":"  there is no per-op against a per-step anywhere above, and no\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463893685,"data":"  whole-step denominator is used.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463895888,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463897975,"data":"  Every fla cell above is a millisecond of the configuration named in\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463900238,"data":"  FLA_SCOPE.  It is not a millisecond of fla.\n"}
