,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463957358,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463959637,"data":"5. THE CLEAN-vs-DEGRADED GAP: an open unknown, not a number\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463961895,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463964184,"data":"  MEASURED: fla on one T4, in the configuration this session observed\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463966453,"data":"  the T4's 65536 B of optin shared memory and its sm_75\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463968723,"data":"  compute capability force on it.  That is all.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463971027,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463973137,"data":"  NOT MEASURED, and not estimated anywhere in this file: what the same\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463975416,"data":"  code does on a card with \u003e= 166,912 B optin shared memory AND cc major\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463977712,"data":"  \u003e= 8.  Scaling this number by a stage ratio, a tile ratio or a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463979984,"data":"  precision ratio would be inventing a measurement.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463982217,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463984312,"data":"  The four gap classes this project uses (notes/19 section 6):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463986605,"data":"    (i)   the DSL cannot express it\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463988802,"data":"    (ii)  the DSL can express it and does not find it\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463991023,"data":"    (iii) not yet implemented on the DSL side\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.46399324,"data":"    (iv)  does not exist for this arch\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463995534,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463997643,"data":"  REACHABLE by this measurement:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.463999835,"data":"    (ii)  If a port lands close to fla-on-T4, the residual is a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464002099,"data":"          scheduling question and this run can address it, because both\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464004387,"data":"          sides are on the same silicon with the same numerics and the\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464006643,"data":"          same degraded reference configuration.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464009073,"data":"    (i)   Reachable only negatively: a port that lands orders of\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464011325,"data":"          magnitude off cannot be separated into (i) vs (ii) by a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464013565,"data":"          timing alone.  The three-port ladder is the instrument for\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464015822,"data":"          that, and it is reported above.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464018033,"data":"    (iii) The ladder across the three ports measures exactly this, if\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464022335,"data":"          all three are present.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464024618,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464026723,"data":"  STRUCTURALLY UNREACHABLE by this measurement, at any run quality:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.46402898,"data":"    (iv)  Fixed by the silicon.  There is no bf16 MMA below sm_80 and\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464031228,"data":"          IS_TF32_SUPPORTED is False, so fla's tl.dot cannot reach a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464033481,"data":"          tensor core on this card however long the run takes.  A gap\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464035704,"data":"          that is really 'fla emits HMMA and TinyGrad emits FFMA' is\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464037976,"data":"          (iv) here -- and is untouched by every number above, because\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464040223,"data":"          the HMMA never executes on this device.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464042455,"data":"    ALSO UNREACHABLE: fla-in-its-worst-config versus fla-in-its-best.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464044702,"data":"          That needs the card this study does not have.  It stays open.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3525.464046958,"data":"\n"}
